   "label": "f01-rule-order",
   "front": "List reconcileWorkflow's rules in order.",
   "back": "1 declined or deniedAt: DENIED; 2 servicingHandedOffAt: SERVICING_HANDOFF; 3 disbursedAt: DISBURSEMENT; 4 no intake: INTAKE; 5 any FAILED or missing/non-PASSED required verification: VERIFICATION; 6 decision PENDING or REFER: CREDIT_DECISIONING; 7 a FAILED condition: CONDITIONS; 8 an OPEN condition: CONDITIONS; 9 APPROVED: APPROVED; else unchanged. The order is the policy.",
   "observation": "read-derived",
